An incorrect naively fused version of Figure <a href="#S2.F1.sf1" title="In Figure 1 ‣ 2. Motivation ‣ Neptune: Advanced ML Operator Fusion for Locality and Parallelism on GPUs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1(a)</span></a>.
<span id="S2.F1.sf2.14.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">s_exp</span> and <span id="S2.F1.sf2.14.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">s_sum</span> are fused under <span id="S2.F1.sf2.14.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">loop_j</span> without considering the data dependencies.
</span></figcaption>
</figure></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_3">
