This schedule pairs with the compute definition in Figure <a href="#A1.F8" title="Figure 8 ‣ Appendix A Neptune Inputs ‣ Neptune: Advanced ML Operator Fusion for Locality and Parallelism on GPUs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8</span></a>.</span></figcaption>
