<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex20.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=g(r^{\prime},r+\ln(t))=\exp(r-r^{\prime})\cdot t" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">g</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><msup><mi mathsize="0.900em">r</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">′</mo></msup><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">r</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">r</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><msup><mi mathsize="0.900em">r</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">′</mo></msup></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" rspace="0.055em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=g(r^{\prime},r+\ln(t))=\exp(r-r^{\prime})\cdot t</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table></div><div class="ltx_flex_break"></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1">
<p id="A3.F10.sf4.3" class="ltx_p ltx_figure_panel"><span id="A3.F10.sf4.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Proving commutativity with <math id="A3.F10.sf4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="f" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>f</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f</annotation></semantics></math>:</span></p></div><div class="ltx_flex_break"></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1">
<table id="A3.Ex21" class="ltx_equation ltx_figure_panel ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_figure_panel ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A3.Ex21.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="h(x+y,r,r^{\prime})=\exp(r-r^{\prime})\cdot(x+y)=h(x,r,r^{\prime})+h(y,r,r^{\prime})" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">h</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">x</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">y</mi></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">r</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><msup><mi mathsize="0.900em">r</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">′</mo></msup><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">r</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><msup><mi mathsize="0.900em">r</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">′</mo></msup></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" rspace="0.055em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">x</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">y</mi></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">h</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">x</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">r</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><msup><mi mathsize="0.900em">r</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">′</mo></msup><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">h</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">y</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">r</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><msup><mi mathsize="0.900em">r</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">′</mo></msup><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">h(x+y,r,r^{\prime})=\exp(r-r^{\prime})\cdot(x+y)=h(x,r,r^{\prime})+h(y,r,r^{\prime})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table></div></div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption" style="font-size:90%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">(d) </span>Step 4: finding the repair function <math id="A3.F10.sf4.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="h" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>h</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">h</annotation></semantics></math>. Find the inverse of <math id="A3.F10.sf4.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="g" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>g</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">g</annotation></semantics></math>,
use Equation <a href="#S4.E6" title="In Theorem 4.3. ‣ 4.1. Rolling Update ‣ 4. Template-Guided Optimizer ‣ Neptune: Advanced ML Operator Fusion for Locality and Parallelism on GPUs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a> to find <math id="A3.F10.sf4.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="h" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>h</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">h</annotation></semantics></math>,
and prove Equation <a href="#S4.E5" title="In Theorem 4.2. ‣ 4.1. Rolling Update ‣ 4. Template-Guided Optimizer ‣ Neptune: Advanced ML Operator Fusion for Locality and Parallelism on GPUs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a> (commutativity with <math id="A3.F10.sf4.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="f" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>f</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f</annotation></semantics></math>) for <math id="A3.F10.sf4.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="h" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>h</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">h</annotation></semantics></math>.</figcaption>
</figure></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_2">
<figure id="A3.F10.sf5" class="ltx_figure ltx_figure_panel ltx_align_center">
<div class="ltx_flex_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1">
<p id="A3.F10.sf5.3" class="ltx_p ltx_figure_panel"><span id="A3.F10.sf5.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">For <span id="A3.F10.sf5.3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">s_max</span>, cache its output <span id="A3.F10.sf5.3.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">xmax</span> for the previous iteration:</span></p></div><div class="ltx_flex_break"></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1">
<table id="A3.Ex22" class="ltx_equation ltx_figure_panel ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_figure_panel ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A3.Ex22.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\texttt{{xmax\_0}[i]}:=\texttt{{xmax}[i]}^{\langle j-1\rangle};\hskip 9.24994pt\texttt{{xmax\_1}[i]}:=\texttt{{xmax}[i]}^{\langle j\rangle}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace" mathsize="0.900em">xmax_0[i]</mtext><mo mathsize="0.900em">:=</mo><msup><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace" mathsize="0.900em">xmax[i]</mtext><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">j</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em" rspace="1.097em">;</mo><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace" mathsize="0.900em">xmax_1[i]</mtext><mo mathsize="0.900em">:=</mo><msup><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace" mathsize="0.900em">xmax[i]</mtext><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">j</mi><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\texttt{{xmax\_0}[i]}:=\texttt{{xmax}[i]}^{\langle j-1\rangle};\hskip 9.24994pt\texttt{{xmax\_1}[i]}:=\texttt{{xmax}[i]}^{\langle j\rangle}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table></div><div class="ltx_flex_break"></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1">
<p id="A3.F10.sf5.4" class="ltx_p ltx_figure_panel"><span id="A3.F10.sf5.4.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Apply <math id="A3.F10.sf5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="h(t,r,r^{\prime})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">h(t,r,r^{\prime})</annotation></semantics></math> with <math id="A3.F10.sf5.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r=\texttt{{xmax\_0}[i]}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace">xmax_0[i]</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r=\texttt{{xmax\_0}[i]}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A3.F10.sf5.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r^{\prime}=\texttt{{xmax\_1}[i]}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace">xmax_1[i]</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r^{\prime}=\texttt{{xmax\_1}[i]}</annotation></semantics></math>:</span></p></div><div class="ltx_flex_break"></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1">
<table id="A3.EGx8" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_figure_panel ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A3.Ex23"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><span id="A3.Ex23.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_markedasmath ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#278117;">xsum[i]</span></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex23.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\exp(\texttt{{xmax\_0}[i]}-\texttt{{xmax\_1}[i]})\cdot\texttt{{xsum}[i]}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace" mathsize="0.900em">xmax_0[i]</mtext><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace" mathsize="0.900em">xmax_1[i]</mtext></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" rspace="0.055em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace" mathsize="0.900em">xsum[i]</mtext></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\exp(\texttt{{xmax\_0}[i]}-\texttt{{xmax\_1}[i]})\cdot\texttt{{xsum}[i]}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A3.Ex24"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex24.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle+\exp(\texttt{inp[i, j]}-\texttt{{xmax\_1}[i]})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0.167em">+</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace" mathsize="0.900em">inp[i, j]</mtext><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace" mathsize="0.900em">xmax_1[i]</mtext></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle+\exp(\texttt{inp[i, j]}-\texttt{{xmax\_1}[i]})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table></div></div>
